{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9bc41c68c8d0eb6475eae2226c996ea1b84457b7a3dec779c187676289b38cd4", "ja": "（朋花に、学園ドラマの出演オファーがあった。\nさっそく本人の意向を聞いてみよう！）", "zh": "（朋花接到了出演校园剧的邀约。赶紧去问问她本人的意愿吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5987b78d8d7d38274490ff07e048c7deb36be0b0086b7182475e62be23da376d", "ja": "……というワケで、\n学園ドラマに出てもらいたいんだ！", "zh": "……事情就是这样，\n我想请你出演校园剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "e800930f039f372f37ca3bfe95a6a1befdc2a2eb0d2e5ca4ab7c80dd63a69af2", "ja": "それはそれは、ありがたい話ですね～。\n多くの子豚ちゃんに、聖母の愛を届ける機会です～。", "zh": "这真是个令人感激的提议呢～。\n这是向许多小猪猪传递圣母之爱的机会～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "c0b3d1e5848aee32fb09a1073b4e8edef29619a6bf1a2e917f19fcb85f6a7edd", "ja": "いい仕事を持ってきてくれましたね。\n{$P$}さん、褒めてあげますよ～♪", "zh": "你带来了一份不错的工作呢。\n{$P$}先生，我要好好夸奖你哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1ca288ef79824adab8bf2da30282581d66924b9dbbe69ee7dfcad9f9ae9dc9a0", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！　それで、\nうちのアイドル達が結構出るドラマなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！是这样的，\n这部电视剧里我们这边的偶像会有不少出演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65f1ffcce6d03fd1f61ba19d1ec8ce4cea3aac718fed9425bd9178708714d0e8", "ja": "主役級のオファーが、もうひとりきてるんだ。", "zh": "还有一位也收到了主演级别的邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca90a0fe2e24917d53263f668221ed319c0fdb068019f9b90c9c26489e873675", "ja": "つまり、ダブル主演ということですね～。\n誰なんですか～？", "zh": "也就是说，是双主演对吧～。\n那个人是谁呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1465f50ee2bbf0d4e62ac846fe0a84c718e6f4c39c7c9602725a1f8483e5f5d4", "ja": "まつりだ。朋花とまつりが、\nライバル的な立ち位置になるみたいだ。", "zh": "是茉莉。看来朋花和茉莉\n会是类似劲敌的定位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "d808344d170e698078ffdb8c0357d15d208e5625dbd4581856c33a0be9f0dfd8", "ja": "おや～、私だけではなく、まつりさんもとは、\n欲張りなキャスティングですね～。", "zh": "哎呀～不只是我，连まつり小姐也是吗？还真是贪心的选角呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dbe9818fd757201dff881e092b0fb5e7ef3a90fa1266d4f87e9fb778e1681a4b", "ja": "どうだろう？　引き受けてもらえるか？", "zh": "你觉得怎么样？愿意接下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "fd674f49910fb72b76f1604667045463d8525c3be37792243c536b87bf77a8dd", "ja": "なるほど～。……そんな質問をするとは、\n{$P$}さんもまだまだですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～……居然会问这种问题，\n看来{$P$}先生还差得远呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "22254e6d89fc9b2aba215b974e63cde63706dd714e298687015c26dc49d5d792", "ja": "それで私が断るとでも思いましたか～？\nまつりさんには、負けませんよ～♪", "zh": "你觉得我会拒绝吗～？\n我可不会输给小松丽哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c85102a2c9299299e991456d53ea173de602a2febb8223f80a70632599ca0138", "ja": "ということは……。", "zh": "这么说来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "13f3222bc7741773c713d85bd630d6912060744d62e62357979c20c578d25b68", "ja": "もちろん、お引き受けしますよ～。\nまつりさんなら、いい勝負になるでしょう～。", "zh": "当然，我接受哦～。\n如果是茉莉的话，一定会是一场精彩的较量吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "3441cf12891259c32223235e095040c2efe9156cc2b19ae3ef2f91cf1395cd42", "ja": "テレビの前の子豚ちゃんたちも、きっと、\n私たちの姿を見て、喜んでくれると思います～。", "zh": "电视机前的小猪们看到我们的身影，也一定会很开心的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9476ef961db7dc61e9b44246ff37a1abbf63730551cba2fd15f993d4300ac4e1", "ja": "そうか！　よかった。\nまつりとのライバル対決、頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "这样啊！那就好。\n和茉莉的对决，你可要加油啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "aa31d2be2a50a26bbe4634e4c390b8154e8354f700cac1b13a791162a64772f6", "ja": "はい～。ですが、頑張るのは\n{$P$}さんもですよ～？", "zh": "是～。不过，要加油的也包括{$P$}先生哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "c5e144b3688f928105f6ccda3ecf48e67e3eed18a8edb37e10d6799a6e72fd34", "ja": "私たちの魅力を余すことなく伝えるために、\nいつも以上に尽力してもらいますからね～。", "zh": "为了将我们的魅力完整地传达出去，\n要请您比平时更加努力才行哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7283fc7c1c06f4cc0e40a23c891262f81c335d49ab34b3c179a796fa7c9ef348", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "啊，当然。一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "4b3b9e9df569ebf33c69ef787b9d2292db4534011db43ea9d45846f08c4ea92f", "ja": "そうですね～、もし至らないところがあれば……。\n居残りで、お説教ですからね～？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "是啊～，要是有哪里做得不够好……  \n可就要留下来听我说教了哦～？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0193_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4c0111a4021a32b807c2c0ecab2aa7fbab35e8ae7c246f2b859ff52e2b27ed93", "ja": "（居残りか、なんだか青春って感じだ……。\nはっ！　いやいや、全力でフォローするぞ！）", "zh": "（留下来加练吗，总觉得很有青春的感觉……\n啊！不对不对，我要全力帮忙才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
